The code in this repository is MIT licensed. The two data files are not ours.

`expansion_log_scaled.csv` is derived from the OpenADMET-ExpansionRx Blind
Challenge data set, which is licensed CC BY 4.0 and is redistributed here under
those terms.

`biogen_adme_3521.csv` is derived from `ADME_public_set_3521.csv` in
github.com/molecularinformatics/Computational-ADME, released by Biogen under
the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 molecularinformatics, with the paper of
Fang et al., J. Chem. Inf. Model. 2023, 63 (11), 3263-3274. Columns were renamed
and a `cluster` and a `ds` column were added by `00b_prepare_biogen.py`. The
measurements are unchanged.

See the "Data" section of README.md for attribution of both.
